 662:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Qspi/Std/IfxQspi.h **** * \retval TRUE If a receive request is pending.
 663:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Qspi/Std/IfxQspi.h **** *         FALSE If no receive request is pending.
 664:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Qspi/Std/IfxQspi.h **** */
